---

TASK: Generate a detailed technical flat drawing description for this garment specification.
This description will be used by an SVG renderer — not drawn by AI directly.

GARMENT SPEC:
{{ spec | tojson(indent=2) }}

DESCRIBE EACH ELEMENT for the {{ view_type }} view:

For FRONT view, describe:
1. Overall outline and proportions (width at shoulder, chest, waist, hip, hem)
2. Neckline shape (exact curve type, depth)
3. Each panel boundary (seam lines)
4. Dart positions and directions
5. Pocket outlines and stitch lines
6. Collar/lapel shape
7. Sleeve outline and seam
8. Closure position and hardware
9. Embroidery placement boxes
10. Hem type

For BACK view, describe:
1. Back outline
2. Back seaming / yoke lines
3. Closure on back if any
4. Back dart positions

OUTPUT: Return JSON with "panels" array where each panel has:
- name: panel identifier
- type: "outline" | "seam_line" | "dart" | "pocket" | "embroidery_zone" | "stitch_line"
- description: human-readable description for the SVG renderer
- approximate_coordinates: relative positions as percentages (0-100) of bounding box
